  "thag1.6:1.2": "eko santusito samāhitatto ",
  "thag1.6:1.3": "vijitāvi apetalomahaṃso ",
  "thag1.6:1.4": "rakkhaṃ kāyagatāsatiṃ dhitīmā ",
  "thag1.6:1.5": "'ti. Yo pānudi "
